# Whitespace rule for `git diff --check` only. There are deliberately no `text` / `eol` attributes:
# line endings are not normalized here (docs/WORKFLOW.md, Repository conventions; CURRENT-STATE D12).
# Many tracked files are stored with CRLF. `cr-at-eol` treats a CR before LF as part of the line
# ending; trailing whitespace, space-before-tab and new blank lines at EOF are still reported.
* whitespace=cr-at-eol
